  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">OTP Security Best Practices</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
